    <!-- Section 5: Buyer Decision Tree & Best Practices -->
    <section id="decision-tree" class="scroll-mt-24 mb-14">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-100 flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-6 bg-amber-500 rounded-full inline-block"></span>
        移动端使用场景决策树
      </h2>
      <div class="text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-amber-50/70 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-5 space-y-3 my-4">
          
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-200/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs flex-shrink-0">iPhone 深度用户</span>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
                <strong>追求省心、全天开着不耗电、通知准时推送：</strong> 在美区 App Store 购买安装正版 Shadowrocket，导入光速云订阅，开启规则分流，全天免维护。
              </p>
            </div>
          
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-200/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs flex-shrink-0">安卓商务旗舰</span>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
                <strong>使用华为、小米等国产定制系统处理跨国业务：</strong> 安装 v2rayNG，务必完成“电池无限制 + 自动启动 + 任务锁定”三部曲，确保出差路上随时稳定秒连。
              </p>
            </div>
          
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span class="font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-200/80 px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs flex-shrink-0">经常出差高铁族</span>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-800 leading-relaxed">
                <strong>在高铁、地铁等信号极差的弱网环境下频繁漫游：</strong> 优先选择光速云的多节点 Fallback 自动容灾组，配合低延迟香港专线，在基站跳变时迅速自愈恢复。
              </p>
            </div>
          
        </div>

